The public half of the key axon releases are signed with.
Axon releases are signed with the same key as Storm's (the private
half is the RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY Actions secret on this repo, with
the owner's backup copy in his offline storage). The release
workflow refuses to sign with a key whose public half is not
listed here. Only public keys belong in this file.

-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEAbYrC7/OVRVsfm0+Qp949clyqldw6rgpAdjauxnYHfHc=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
